/surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lombardi</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Tonello</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Granzotto</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Marzolo</surname><given-names>MO</given-names></name><name><surname>Carruba</surname><given-names>MO</given-names></name><name><surname>Ricquier</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Federspil</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Nisoli</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Changes in FAT/CD36, UCP2, UCP3 and GLUT4 gene expression during lipid infusion in rat skeletal and heart muscle</article-title><source>Int J Obes Relat Metab Disord</source><year>2002</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>838</fpage><lpage>847</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.ijo.0802005</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Vettor R, Fabris R, Serra R, Lombardi AM, Tonello C, Granzotto M, Marzolo MO, Carruba MO, Ricquier D, Federspil G, Nisoli E (2002) Changes in FAT/CD36, UCP2, UCP3 and GLUT4 gene expression during lipid infusion in rat skeletal and heart muscle. Int J Obes Relat Metab Disord 26:838&#x02013;847 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12037655</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR18"><label>19.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zadelaar</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kleemann</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Verschuren</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Vries-Van der Weij</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoorn</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Princen</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Kooistra</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mouse models for atherosclerosis and pharma